---
import { resume } from '../config/resume';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/') ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL : `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/`;
const resumeHref = `${base}resume/`;
---

<section class="section about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="container about-inner">
    <div class="about-copy reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Meet Catalina</span>
      <h2 id="about-title">I get to know the family.<br />Then we find your rhythm.</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        I&rsquo;m Catalina Llamas, a Queens-based nanny, postpartum doula, and house
        manager. Over {resume.highlights[0].value}, I&rsquo;ve cared for newborn twins,
        growing toddlers, preschoolers, and children who need extra support &mdash;
        alongside the parents learning each new stage with them.
      </p>
      <p>
        My work has taken me into homes across Queens and Brooklyn, after earlier
        years caring for families in Florida. Every home has its own pace, its own
        ways of doing things, and its own version of a difficult afternoon. I listen
        for those details before suggesting what could help.
      </p>
      <p>
        Newborn and postpartum care are a particular focus of mine. So is the life
        around the baby: an older sibling&rsquo;s routine, a parent returning to work,
        a caregiver learning the household, and a plan that everyone can actually follow.
      </p>
      <div class="about-actions">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-secondary">Tell me about your family</a>
        <a href={resumeHref} class="about-resume-link">Read my experience &amp; training &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="family-story reveal reveal-delay-1" aria-labelledby="story-title">
      <span class="story-kicker">One family, several chapters</span>
      <h3 id="story-title">From their first routines<br />to their third baby.</h3>
      <p>With one Brooklyn family, I cared for two children from infancy through toddlerhood. I was there for feeding changes, potty training, daily outings, and the move from crib to toddler bed.</p>
      <p>When their third newborn arrived, I returned for overnight postpartum support. I already knew the household and the older children &mdash; and we could build the new plan around the family they had become.</p>
      <p class="story-note">A chapter from my own care experience.</p>
      <dl class="experience-notes">
        <div><dt>8 years</dt><dd>Hands-on care, from newborn days to growing family routines</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Español &amp; English</dt><dd>Bilingual communication and experience supporting bilingual development</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </aside>
  </div>
  <div class="container training-strip reveal">
    <span class="eyebrow">The training behind my care</span>
    <ul role="list">{resume.training.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul>
    <p class="scope-note">For children with specialized medical or developmental needs, I work within parent and provider instructions. My role is practical family support alongside their care team.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about { background: var(--color-cream); }
  .about-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr; align-items: start; gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); }
  .about-copy h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.3vw, 2.7rem); margin-bottom: 0.7em; }
  .about-copy > p:not(.lead) { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 0.96rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .about-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 1rem 1.4rem; margin-top: 1.75rem; }
  .about-resume-link { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .family-story { background: var(--color-blush-100); border-left: 2px solid var(--color-maroon-300); padding: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem); }
  .story-kicker { font-size: 0.7rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-maroon-500); }
  .family-story h3 { margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 1.7rem; line-height: 1.25; }
  .family-story > p { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .family-story .story-note { font-size: 0.75rem; font-style: italic; }
  .experience-notes { margin: 1.75rem 0 0; }
  .experience-notes div { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); padding-block: 0.9rem; }
  .experience-notes div:last-child { padding-bottom: 0; }
  .experience-notes dt { font-family: var(--font-display); color: var(--color-maroon-700); font-size: 1.35rem; }
  .experience-notes dd { margin: 0.25rem 0 0; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.65; }
  .training-strip { margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem); }
  .training-strip ul { margin: 0; padding: 1.25rem 0; border-block: 1px solid var(--color-border); list-style: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
  .training-strip li { font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-maroon-700); line-height: 1.65; }
  .scope-note { max-width: 90ch; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--color-muted); margin: 1rem 0 0; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .about-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .family-story { max-width: 580px; } .training-strip ul { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 420px) { .training-strip ul { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.75rem; } }
</style>
